      "widgets_values": [
        "KLING EASY LAYERS • VISUAL EDITOR (CPU)\n\n1. Choose an existing Kling image in Load Image. No paid Kling call.\n2. In \"Easy Layers\" leave selection on Auto for product/person and background on Repair.\n3. Click QUEUE once. The automatic CPU model may download on first use.\n4. In \"Create Layered Image\", open its VISUAL COMPOSITOR / EDITOR.\n5. Drag the foreground object, resize, hide/show, adjust opacity, and save the composition.\n6. Queue again to update Save Image when you changed the editor layout.\n\nManual selection (for objects rembg cannot detect): paint the object in Load Image's mask editor, connect its MASK output to Easy Layers, and switch selection to Manual.\n\nThis produces two editable RASTER layers, not a text/vector design file. ComfyUI's native editor is needed for drag-and-drop. If you cannot find \"Create Layered Image\", update ComfyUI/frontend."
      ],
      "title": "Quick start — drag objects visually"
    }
